    "details": "Martin Donath reports:\n\n> Material for MkDocs 7.2.0 through 9.7.6 contains a DOM-based\n> cross-site scripting vulnerability in the optional search.suggest\n> feature. A crafted q URL parameter could execute JavaScript in the\n> documentation site\\'s origin after user interaction.\n",
